.. _api_cpp_geom_Grid:

==========
geom::Grid
==========

.. note::
   Generated from the C++ headers by ``apiary --emit-cpp-docs-json``.

Defined in header ``geom/Templates.hpp``.

.. cpp:namespace:: geom

.. cpp:class:: template <typename T, size_t Rank = 2> Grid

   A fixed-rank grid of values.

   :tparam T: The element type.
   :tparam Rank: The number of dimensions.


   .. cpp:function:: Grid()

      Build an empty grid.


   .. cpp:function:: template <typename F, bool Unroll = false> void fill(const F &f)

      Fill every cell from a generator.

      :tparam F: The generator type.
      :tparam Unroll: Whether to unroll the fill loop.
      :param f: The generator.


   .. cpp:function:: template <size_t NewRank, typename... Dims> Grid<T, NewRank> reshape(Dims... dims) const

      Reshape to another rank.

      :tparam NewRank: The rank of the result.
      :tparam Dims: The extents, one per dimension.
